cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the HTAN package, please cite the software and the Human Tumor
  Atlas Network.
type: software
title: 'HTAN: Query and Retrieve Human Tumor Atlas Network (HTAN) Open-Access Data'
abstract: >-
  An R/Bioconductor client for the open-access data of the Human Tumor Atlas
  Network (HTAN), Phase 1. Metadata are queried locally from a versioned
  parquet snapshot of the ISB-CGC HTAN release tables through DuckDB, with no
  Google account; open files are downloaded from the CRDC General Commons or
  Synapse and read into Bioconductor classes.
